# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), @ROxPinTeddy
# Date: 2020-05-12
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1046, attack.t1135
# Description: Detects the use of Advanced IP Scanner. Seems to be a popular tool for ransomware groups.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((CommandLine CONTAIN "/portable" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "/lng")) OR ((Image CONTAIN "\\advanced_ip_scanner") OR (OriginalFileName CONTAIN "advanced_ip_scanner") OR (Description CONTAIN "Advanced IP Scanner")))
